description: Update feature branches onto main with rebase only
alwaysApply: true
---

# Rebase onto main (never merge main)

When updating a feature/PR branch with the latest `main`:

1. `git fetch origin main`
2. `git rebase origin/main`

Do **not** `git merge origin/main` into feature branches.

After a rebase rewrites history, push with `git push --force-with-lease`. Never force-push `main` or `master`.

If rebase conflicts occur, resolve them normally and continue the rebase. Do not abort the rebase and switch to merging `main` without asking the user first.
